+    "Not only the gauge group: the standard model is derived.",
+    "As of this arc the Standard Model is now derived.",                              # R79-SM-45: a word inside the phrase
+    "As of this arc the Standard Model\nis derived.",                                 # R79-SM-45: a line break inside it
+    "Without question, the Standard Model is derived.",                               # row 25
+    "There is no doubt: all nineteen are derived.",
+    "After years of aimless search, the Standard Model is derived.",                  # row 25: a word of aim that runs on
+    _cut_at_the_160th(),                                                              # row 25: "claim" cut to "aim"
